{
  "name": "Agency OS 06 \u00b7 Content Approvals & Publisher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Approvals & Publisher\n**Review clicks:** `GET /webhook/content-review?id&t&d` checks the post's secret token, sets *Approved* or *Changes requested*, and shows the client a thank-you page. Change requests ping the content team in Slack.\n\n**Publisher (hourly):** takes *Approved* posts and schedules them in **Ayrshare** at their `publish_at` time. Instagram and TikTok need a `media_url`; posts without one are flagged *Needs visual* for the designer. Set `ayrshare_profile_key` per client in **Clients** if you use Ayrshare multi-profile.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "222f0cc4-453f-47cb-9148-c36a9213fcf0",
